# Include only specific folders and files
/*

# But include these folders
!TrajectoryRealTime/
!TrajectoryGeneration/
!TrajectoryExecution/
!ViconDataStream/
!config/
!logs/
!third_party/

# Include all .cpp files in root
!*.cpp

# Include root CMakeLists.txt
!CMakeLists.txt

# Include shared coding-agent instructions and engineering documentation
!AGENTS.md
!CLAUDE.md
!.claude/
!.claude/**
# ...except machine-local Claude Code state
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock
# Agent worktrees are live checkouts of this repository (each carries its own
# .git file and is registered in `git worktree list`). They are transient
# local state, never source.
.claude/worktrees/
!docs/
!docs/**

# Include this .gitignore file
!.gitignore

# Include Christian_control source (but not its build/IDE output)
!Christian_control/
Christian_control/**/build/
Christian_control/**/cmake-build-*/
Christian_control/**/.idea/
__pycache__/

# clangd index cache
.cache/

# Playwright MCP scratch (screenshots, snapshots) from UI checks
.playwright-mcp/
